        "whyGood": "The most rewarding driver's car in the batch — 333hp supercharged 3.0T V6 quattro AWD, and a proper hardtop cabriolet body for under $11k. The B8 S5 Cabriolet was a $60k car new. 92,034 miles on a supercharged V6 is manageable with proper service. Good Deal badge from Cars.com. Also cross-listed on CarGurus and AutoTrader — confirms the asking price is market-rate.",
